0..40 Comment "//! This source evolves a seat protocol."
41..44 Comment "//!"
45..80 Comment "//! Session subtyping gives a flow."
81..123 Comment "//! Equi-recursive unfolding gives a path."
124..180 Comment "//! A protocol with an added seat choice is a supertype."
181..230 Comment "//! An old run rides forward to the new protocol."
231..292 Comment "//! The old protocol rejects a run that takes the new choice."
293..296 Comment "//!"
297..344 Comment "//! The checker verifies the flow and the path."
345..391 Comment "//! The checker refuses an unadmitted old run."
